{comment: Verse 1}
[C]Oh Danny Boy, the [F]pipes, the pipes are [C]calling
From [G]glen to glen, and [Dm]down the mountain [G]side
The [C]summer's gone, and [F]all the roses [C]falling
It's [G]you, it's you must [G7]go and I must [C]bide

{comment: Verse 2}
But [C]come ye back when [F]summer's in the [C]meadow
Or when the [G]valley's hushed and [Dm]white with [G]snow
It's [C]I'll be here in [F]sunshine or in [C]shadow
Oh [Am]Danny Boy, oh [F]Danny Boy, I [G]love you [C]so
